<title>POLAND: Polish shares mixed in Warsaw continuous trade.</title>
<headline>Polish shares mixed in Warsaw continuous trade.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-09-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in one company closed higher, one lower and two were flat in Warsaw bourse continuous trade on Friday, with turnover at 455,400 zlotys. On Thursday no stocks traded.</p>
<p>NFI units fell 1.7 percent to 116 zlotys in a turnover of 4.3 million zlotys.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
